  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEDAIL: Systematization of Legal and Educational Assistance in San Jose de los Llanos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To elaborate a report which collects experiences of the work carried out by CEDAIL in San Jose de los Llanos between 2000-2005

To create a programme of legal services and assistance for the Batey communities which responds to new challenges and new contexts

To produce proposals for redefining work at an institutional level to enable CEDAIL to redefine its perspectives and become better inserted in Dominican society

Share the learning which comes out of the project of systematization with the target population.</narrative>
  </description>
